":"Free book signings!","photographer":"","copyright":"","sequenceNumber":"400"},{"marketVariantId":"","multimediaId":"6a84ee14f0881b6f2dc88535500","authoredDate":"2026-09-14","serverPath":"https://vimeo.com/1137867635?fl=tl&fe=ec&share=copy","videoId":"","videoThumbnailPath":"https://i.vimeocdn.com/video/2084027477-bd1be623364a0d18b424069adf372b682dc45b5a26c47d3792c52d2deab02fb7-d_295x166?region=us","videoThumbnailPathMaxRes":"https://i.vimeocdn.com/video/2084027477-bd1be623364a0d18b424069adf372b682dc45b5a26c47d3792c52d2deab02fb7-d_1280?region=us","attributeIdMultimediaFile":"","attributeIdMultimediaFileDescription":"","attributeIdMultimediaContent":"VIDEO","attributeIdMultimediaContentDescription":"Video","attributeIdSizeOrientation":"","attributeIdSizeOrientationDescription":"","altText":"","multimediaDescription":"","sequenceNumber":"500"}],"openTimes":[],"productComments":[{"marketVariantId":"English / Global","attributeIdProductComment":"PRODTRANS ","attributeIdProductCommentDescription":"Product Description Translation","sequenceNumber":"","attributeIdLanguageWritten":"ENGLISH","attributeIdLanguageWrittenDescription":"English","commentText":"Come along to the opening night of Storyfest Central Queensland for the Geoglide Prologue Party - a free community event designed for all the family.\n\nIt's a unique opportunity to meet some of Australia's best authors and illustrators and immerse in the fair's festivities with a variety of activities and games.\n\nLooking for a hands-on activity? Dress up in your favourite costume, join the live performances and celebrate all things storytelling. \n\nThe festival bookshop will be open during this event; it is a great opportunity for adults and children to browse the bookshelf and find that perfect book.\n\nA variety of dinner and beverage options available for purchase.\n\nFree event - no registration required."},{"marketVariantId":"French","attributeIdProductComment":"PRODTRANS ","attributeIdProductCommentDescription":"Product Description Translation","sequenceNumber":"100","attributeIdLanguageWritten":"FRENCH","attributeIdLanguageWrittenDescription":"French","commentText":"Venez nombreux à la soirée d'ouverture du Storyfest Central Queensland pour la Geoglide Prologue Party, un événement communautaire gratuit et ouvert à toute la famille.\n\nC'est une occasion unique de rencontrer certains des meilleurs auteurs et illustrateurs australiens et de vous immerger dans l'ambiance festive du festival grâce à une variété d'activités et de jeux.\n\nEnvie de participer ? Enfilez votre plus beau costume, assistez aux spectacles et célébrez l'art du conte sous toutes ses formes.\n\nLa librairie du festival sera ouverte pendant l'événement ; c'est l'occasion idéale pour petits et grands de flâner parmi les rayons et de trouver le livre parfait.\n\nRestauration et boissons disponibles sur place.\n\nÉvénement gratuit – aucune inscription requise."},{"marketVariantId":"Chinese Simplified","attributeIdProductComment":"PRODTRANS ","attributeIdProductCommentDescription":"Product Description Translation","sequenceNumber":"100","attributeIdLanguageWritten":"CHINESE-S","attributeIdLanguageWrittenDescription":"Chinese Simplified","commentText":"欢迎参加昆士兰中部故事节开幕之夜的“Geoglide Prologue Party”——一场适合全家参与的免费社区活动。\n\n这是一个难得的机会，让您有机会与澳大利亚一些最优秀的作家和插画家见面，并通过各种活动和游戏沉浸在故事节的欢乐氛围中。\n\n想体验一些互动活动吗？穿上您最喜欢的服装，加入现场表演，一起庆祝所有与故事相关的事物吧！\n\n活动期间，故事节书店也将开放；这是成人和孩子们浏览书架、寻找心仪书籍的绝佳机会。\n\n现场提供多种晚餐和饮品供您选择。\n\n活动免费，无需注册。"},{"marketVariantId":"Portuguese","attributeIdProductComment":"PRODTRANS ","attributeIdProductCommentDescription":"Product Description Translation","sequenceNumber":"100","attributeIdLanguageWritten":"PORT-EUR","attributeIdLanguageWrittenDescription":"Portuguese","commentText":"Venha participar da festa de abertura do Storyfest Central Queensland, o Geoglide Prologue Party – um evento comunitário gratuito para toda a família.\n\nÉ uma oportunidade única para conhecer alguns dos melhores autores e ilustradores da Austrália e mergulhar nas festividades da feira com diversas atividades e jogos.\n\nProcura uma atividade interativa? Vista sua fantasia favorita, participe das apresentações ao vivo e celebre tudo relacionado à arte de contar histórias.\n\nA livraria do festival estará aberta durante o evento; é uma ótima oportunidade para adultos e crianças explorarem as estantes e encontrarem o livro perfeito.\n\nDiversas opções de jantar e bebidas estarão disponíveis para compra.\n\nEvento gratuito – não é necessário se inscrever."},{"marketVariantId":"Italian","attributeIdProductComment":"PRODTRANS ","attributeIdProductCommentDescription":"Product Description Translation","sequenceNumber":"100","attributeIdLanguageWritten":"ITALIAN","attributeIdLanguageWrittenDescription":"Italian","commentText":"Partecipa alla serata inaugurale di Storyfest Central Queensland per il Geoglide Prologue Party, un evento gratuito per tutta la famiglia.\n\nÈ un'occasione unica per incontrare alcuni dei migliori autori e illustratori australiani e immergerti nell'atmosfera festosa della fiera con una varietà di attività e giochi.\n\nCerchi un'attività interattiva? Indossa il tuo costume preferito, unisciti agli spettacoli dal vivo e celebra il mondo della narrazione.\n\nLa libreria del festival sarà aperta durante l'evento; è un'ottima opportunità per adulti e bambini di curiosare tra gli scaffali e trovare il libro perfetto.\n\nSaranno disponibili diverse opzioni per la cena e le bevande.\n\nEvento gratuito, non è richiesta la registrazione."},{"marketVariantId":"German","attributeIdProductComment":"PRODTRANS ","attributeIdProductCommentDescription":"Product Description Translation","sequenceNumber":"100","attributeIdLanguageWritten":"GERMAN","attributeIdLanguageWrittenDescription":"German","commentText":"Besuchen Sie uns zur Eröffnung des Storyfest Central Queensland mit der Geoglide Prologue Party – einer kostenlosen Veranstaltung für die ganze Familie.\n\nNutzen Sie die einmalige Gelegenheit, einige der besten australischen Autoren und Illustratoren kennenzulernen und in die Festlichkeiten mit vielfältigen Aktivitäten und Spielen einzutauchen.\n\nLust auf Mitmachaktionen? Verkleiden Sie sich in Ihrem Lieblingskostüm, erleben Sie Live-Auftritte und feiern Sie die Welt des Geschichtenerzählens.\n\nDer Festival-Buchladen ist während der Veranstaltung geöffnet. Hier können Erwachsene und Kinder in Ruhe stöbern und ihr Lieblingsbuch entdecken.\n\nEs gibt verschiedene Speisen und Getränke zu kaufen.\n\nDie Veranstaltung ist kostenlos – eine Anmeldung ist nicht erforderlich."},{"marketVariantId":"Japanese","attributeIdProductComment":"PRODTRANS ","attributeIdProductCommentDescription":"Product Description Translation","sequenceNumber":"100","attributeIdLanguageWritten":"JAPANESE","attributeIdLanguageWrittenDescription":"Japanese","commentText":"ストーリーフェスト・セントラルクイーンズランドのオープニングナイト、ジオグライド・プロローグ・パーティーにぜひお越しください。ご家族皆様でお楽しみいただける無料のコミュニティイベントです。\n\nオーストラリアを代表する作家やイラストレーターに会えるまたとない機会です。様々なアクティビティやゲームを通して、フェアの賑わいを存分にお楽しみください。\n\n体験型アクティビティをお探しですか？お気に入りのコスチュームを着て、ライブパフォーマンスに参加し、物語の世界を心ゆくまで満喫しましょう。\n\nイベント開催中は、フェスティバルのブックショップも営業しています。大人も子供も、棚を眺めながらお気に入りの一冊を見つける絶好の機会です。\n\nお食事やお飲み物も各種ご用意しております。\n\n参加無料、事前登録不要です。"},{"marketVariantId":"Korean","attributeIdProductComment":"PRODTRANS ","attributeIdProductCommentDescription":"Product Description Translation","sequenceNumber":"100","attributeIdLanguageWritten":"KOREAN","attributeIdLanguageWrittenDescription":"Korean","commentText":"스토리페스트 센트럴 퀸즐랜드 개막일인 지오글라이드 프롤로그 파티에 여러분을 초대합니다! 온 가족이 함께 즐길 수 있는 무료 커뮤니티 행사입니다.\n\n호주 최고의 작가와 일러스트레이터들을 만나고 다양한 활동과 게임을 통해 축제의 분위기를 만끽할 수 있는 특별한 기회입니다.\n\n직접 체험하고 싶으신가요? 좋아하는 의상을 입고 오셔서 라이브 공연에 참여하고 이야기의 모든 것을 함께 즐겨보세요.\n\n축제 서점도 운영되니 어른과 아이 모두 책꽂이를 둘러보며 마음에 쏙 드는 책을 찾아보세요.\n\n다양한 저녁 식사와 음료도 구매하실 수 있습니다.\n\n무료 행사이며 사전 등록은 필요 없습니다."},{"marketVariantId":"Indonesian","attributeIdProductComment":"PRODTRANS ","attributeIdProductCommentDescription":"Product Description Translation","sequenceNumber":"100","attributeIdLanguageWritten":"INDONESIAN","attributeIdLanguageWrittenDescription":"Indonesian","commentText":"Ayo datang ke malam pembukaan Storyfest Central Queensland untuk Pesta Prolog Geoglide - acara komunitas gratis yang dirancang untuk seluruh keluarga.\n\nIni adalah kesempatan unik untuk bertemu beberapa penulis dan ilustrator terbaik Australia dan menikmati kemeriahan festival dengan berbagai aktivitas dan permainan.\n\nMencari aktivitas langsung? Kenakan kostum favorit Anda, ikuti pertunjukan langsung, dan rayakan semua hal tentang bercerita.\n\nToko buku festival akan buka selama acara ini; ini adalah kesempatan bagus bagi orang dewasa dan anak-anak untuk menjelajahi rak buku dan menemukan buku yang sempurna.\n\nBerbagai pilihan makan malam dan minuman tersedia untuk dibeli.\n\nAcara gratis - tidak perlu registrasi."},{"marketVariantId":"Spanish","attributeIdProductComment":"PRODTRANS ","attributeIdProductCommentDescription":"Product Description Translation","sequenceNumber":"100","attributeIdLanguageWritten":"SPAN-EUR","attributeIdLanguageWrittenDescription":"Spanish","commentText":"Ven a la noche inaugural de Storyfest Central Queensland para la Fiesta de Prólogo de Geoglide, un evento comunitario gratuito diseñado para toda la familia.\n\nEs una oportunidad única para conocer a algunos de los mejores autores e ilustradores de Australia y sumergirte en las festividades de la feria con una variedad de actividades y juegos.\n\n¿Buscas una actividad interactiva? Vístete con tu mejor disfraz únete a las presentaciones en vivo y celebra el arte de contar cuentos.\n\nLa librería del festival estará abierta durante el evento; es una excelente oportunidad para que adultos y niños exploren los estantes y encuentren el libro perfecto.\n\nHabrá una variedad de opciones de cena y bebidas disponibles para comprar.\n\nEvento gratuito: no se requiere inscripción."},{"marketVariantId":"Chinese Traditional","attributeIdProductComment":"PRODTRANS ","attributeIdProductCommentDescription":"Product Description Translation","sequenceNumber":"100","attributeIdLanguageWritten":"CHINESE-T","attributeIdLanguageWrittenDescription":"Chinese Traditional","commentText":"歡迎參加昆士蘭中部故事節開幕之夜的“Geoglide Prologue Party”——一場適合全家參與的免費社區活動。\n\n這是一個難得的機會，讓您有機會與澳洲一些最優秀的作家和插畫家見面，並透過各種活動和遊戲沉浸在故事節的歡樂氛圍中。\n\n想體驗一些互動活動嗎？穿上您最喜歡的服裝，加入現場表演，一起慶祝所有與故事相關的事物吧！\n\n活動期間，故事節書店也將開放；這是成人和孩子們瀏覽書架、尋找心儀書籍的絕佳機會。\n\n現場提供多種晚餐和飲料供您選擇。\n\n活動免費，無需註冊。"}],"productSite":[{"siteName":"Emerald State School","attributeIdSiteType":"VENUE","attributeIdSiteTypeDescription":"Venue","productSiteAddressRelationship":[{"attributeIdAddress":"PHYSICAL","attributeIdAddressDescription":"Physical","addressLine1":"Anakie St","addressLine2":"","suburbName":"","cityName":"Emerald","areaName":"","stateName":"Queensland","countryName":"Australia","addressPostalCode":"4720","overrideDomesticRegionFlag":"0","geocodeGdaLatitude":"-23.521974","geocodeGdaLongitude":"148.1613297","productSiteAddressStreetDirectoryRelationship":""}],"productSiteAttributeRelationship":"","productSiteCommentRelationship":"","productSiteCommunicationRelationship":"","productSiteLicenceRelationship":"","productSiteRelatedSiteRelationship":"","productSiteMultimediaRelationship":"","productSiteContactRelationship":""}],"mediaLinks":[],"alternateNames":[{"name":"Somerset Storyfest Ltd. Trading as Storyfest","kind":""}],"internationalReach":"","rates":[{"ratesType":"","ratesTypeDescription":"","priceFrom":"","priceTo":"","free":"true","rateComment":""}],"deals":[],"jobVacancies":[],"weather":"","menuUrl":"","winelistUrl":"","doesServeMeal":"","openingTime":{"openingTimeType":"","seasonalPeriods":[],"openingTimeComment":"","exceptions":{"exceptionPeriod":"","periods":[]}},"productProximity":[],"productWidget":[],"services":[],"verticalClassifications":[{"productTypeId":"FESTIVAL","productTypeDescription":"Festivals and Celebrations"},{"productTypeId":"EVTCOMNTY","productTypeDescription":"Community Events"}],"pageURL":"/au/en/things-to-do/events/p-6a84ee14f0881b6f2dc88535-storyfest-central-queensland--geoglide-prologue-party","classificationLayer":[{"attributeId":"markets-and-community"},{"attributeId":"music-and-festivals"}]}}]},"disabledClassifications":["classes-and-workshops","participation-and-endurance","business-event","food-and-wine"]}